      "problem": "Simplify the expression $|-9a|.$",
      "worked_solution": "Firstly, since $|-a|=|a|,$ we can write our expression as\n\n$$\n|9a|.\n$$\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|9a| & = \\\\ |9\\cdot a| & = \\\\ |9|\\cdot |a| & = \\\\ 9\\cdot |a| & = \\\\ 9|a|\\end{aligned}\n$$",
